#. 掃除当番…？
#. あぁ、それなら僕ですが…それが何か？
msgctxt "0001 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Cleaning duty? As a matter of fact, that's me. Why do\n"
"you ask?"
msgstr ""

#. 昨日の朝、モノクマに頼まれたんですよ。
msgctxt "0002 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"It just so happens Monokuma talked to me yesterday and\n"
"asked me to take care of it."
msgstr ""

#. 掃除当番がいないと
#. 学園中がゴミだらけになってしまうとの事でしたので…
msgctxt "0003 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Without someone on cleaning duty, the school would be\n"
"flooded with trash in no time."
msgstr ""

#. わたくしめが立候補したのです！
msgctxt "0004 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "So I formally applied for the position!"
msgstr ""

#. 本当は、今朝から始める予定だったのですが…
#. あんな事があったせいで実働はまだですがね。
msgctxt "0005 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I was gonna start this morning, but after what\n"
"happened, I haven't had a chance to get started."
msgstr ""

#. 掃除当番って…トラッシュールームに入れるんだよね？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And since you're on cleaning duty...you can open the\n"
"gate in front of the trash room?"
msgstr ""

#. とーぜんでしょう！
msgctxt "0007 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr ""

#. 掃除当番はみんなから集めたゴミをトラッシュルームに
#. 廃棄しなければならないのです。
msgctxt "0008 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"It's my job to gather up all the garbage and toss it\n"
"in the trash room."
msgstr ""

#. トラッシュルームの鉄格子を開ける鍵も
#. ちゃんと受け取ってますがな！！
msgctxt "0009 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"And to do that, they gave me the key for the trash\n"
"room gate!"
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、掃除当番は１週間ごとの交代制らしいので、
#. その内、苗木誠殿も担当する事があるでしょう。
msgctxt "0010 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"But we're supposed to rotate once a week, so\n"
"eventually you'll be in charge."
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと待て…
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Wait, hold on..."
msgstr ""

#. トラッシュルームに入るには鍵が必要…
#. そして、その鍵は掃除当番だけに持たされる…？
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You need a key to get in the trash room? And only the\n"
"person on cleaning duty has access to the key?"
msgstr ""

#. なぜ、そんな面倒をする必要がある？
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What's the point of going to all that trouble?"
msgstr ""

#. トラッシュルームを開放して、
#. 各々が廃棄出来るようにしたらいいはずだ…
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Why not just leave the trash room open all the time so\n"
"we can all throw things out whenever we want?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに…そっちの方が効率的だよね…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That does seem more convenient."
msgstr ""

#. …どうしてだろう。
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So I wonder why..."
msgstr ""

#. ひょっとすると…
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Actually..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>仲間の誰かを殺したクロは“卒業”となりますが、
#. 自分がクロだと他の生徒に知られてはいけません。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Anyone who kills a fellow student and becomes\n"
"\"blackened\" will graduate, unless they are discovered.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …そういう事なのかもしれないな。
msgctxt "0019 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That must be why."
msgstr ""

#. 全員がトラッシュルームに
#. 自由に出入りするようになってしまったら…
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If anyone could go in and out of the trash room\n"
"whenever they wanted..."
msgstr ""

#. 証拠隠滅が簡単になり、
#. スリルがなくてつまらなくなる…
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...then destroying evidence would be easy. The thrill\n"
"would disappear, and things would become boring."
msgstr ""

#. つまらないって…！！
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "B-Boring...!?"
msgstr ""

#. つーかさぁ、今はそれどころじゃなくね？
msgctxt "0023 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "That doesn't matter right now! My question is..."
msgstr ""

#. おい、ブーデー！
#. テメー、なんで掃除当番に立候補しやがった！
msgctxt "0024 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Hey fatty! Why'd you want the cleaning duty gig,\n"
"anyway!?"
msgstr ""

#. ぼ、僕は…みなさんの嫌がる仕事を買って出たまでで…
#. そ、それが何か…？
msgctxt "0025 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I-I just decided to volunteer for something I knew no\n"
"one else would wanna do. What's the big deal!?"
msgstr ""

#. ウソこけっ！！　テメー、さてはアレだろ…
msgctxt "0026 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Liar! I know why you did it..."
msgstr ""

#. 女子のゴミでも漁って…なんか色々と…
#. アレしようって腹じゃ…
msgctxt "0027 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"You wanna dig through all the girls' trash! Looking\n"
"for...y'know...and poking around at it!"
msgstr ""

#. な、何をおっしゃるウサギさん！
#. 僕の愛は２次元限定ですぞっ！！
msgctxt "0028 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "What are you talking about!? All my love is for 2D!"
msgstr ""

#. でもよ、よくあんじゃん！
#. ２次元では飽き足らず実際に犯罪を起こす的な…
msgctxt "0029 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"But there's all kinds of trash diggers like that!\n"
"Maybe you'll get tired of 2D, and then turn to—"
msgstr ""

#. 僕はァァ、２次元に飽きたりしないィィ！
msgctxt "0030 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "I would NEVER get tired of 2D!"
msgstr ""

#. 僕は２次元と３次元とを比較した上で、
#. 自らの意思であえて２次元を選んでいるのだッ！
msgctxt "0031 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"After spending a significant amount of time comparing\n"
"2D and 3D, I voluntarily chose 2D!"
msgstr ""

#. 大体…３次元で存在価値があるものなんて、
#. ２次元を愛する者だけなのだッ！　あとフィギュアね！
msgctxt "0032 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"The only thing 3D is good for is to shower love and\n"
"affection on 2D!"
msgstr ""

#. よく恥ずかしくねーな…
msgctxt "0033 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"How are you not totally embarrassed to say stuff like\n"
"that!?"
msgstr ""

#. …男子が掃除当番の時は、ゴミの収集から廃棄まで、
#. 大神さくらに付き添ってもらえばいいだけだろう…
msgctxt "0034 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Whenever a guy has cleaning duty, Sakura can accompany\n"
"them, from picking up the trash to disposing of it."
msgstr ""

#. なっ！？
msgctxt "0035 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Whaaat!?"
msgstr ""

#. やましい事がないなら、問題ないだろう？
msgctxt "0036 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you're as innocent as you claim, where's the harm\n"
"in it?"
msgstr ""

#. クッ…こんなはずじゃ…！！
msgctxt "0037 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Kh—! That's not how it's supposed to—!"
msgstr ""

#. あのさ山田クン、そんな事よりさ…
#. キミが掃除当番なら、ちょっとお願いがあるんだけど…
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, on another topic... Hifumi, since you were on\n"
"cleaning duty, I have a favor to ask you."
msgstr ""

#. おや、なんですかな？　まさか唐突に仲間になれと？
#. いやいや、まだフラグが立っておりませんぞ。
msgctxt "0039 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"What, so now you suddenly want to join my party?\n"
"Sorry, but you haven't triggered that flag yet."
msgstr ""

#. それは仲間となる人物のトラウマを共に解決したり、
#. 一緒に村を救ったり、または壮絶なバトルを経た後で…
msgctxt "0040 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I mean, you haven't helped me recover from a past\n"
"trauma, or save a village, or beat a boss..."
msgstr ""

#. いや…あのさ…山田クンって掃除当番だろ？
#. トラッシュルームを調べたいんだけど…
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"No, nothing like that... I was just hoping to get into\n"
"the trash room and look around."
msgstr ""

#. いいよ。
msgctxt "0042 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Oh, okay!"
msgstr ""

#. 軽…ッ！
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So easy...!"
msgstr ""

#. あん？　掃除当番…？
#. 知らねぇよ。石丸にでも聞いてみろ？
msgctxt "0044 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "So, Hifumi and I headed down to the trash room."
msgstr ""

#. 掃除当番って…？
msgctxt "0045 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Cleaning duty...?"
msgstr ""

#. そういうのだったら石丸に聞いてみれば？
#. あいつ、その手の決まり事にうるさいし。
msgctxt "0046 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Taka would prolly know more about that, I bet. He's\n"
"pretty uptight about stuff like that."
msgstr ""

#. 掃除当番…？　さぁ、なんの事でしょう。
msgctxt "0047 | CELES"
msgid "Cleaning duty? What is that...?"
msgstr ""

#. 心当たりがありませんわね。
#. 石丸君あたりに聞いてみてはいかがでしょう。
msgctxt "0048 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Honestly, I have no idea. Maybe you should ask Taka.\n"
"Or someone else. Anyone but me, really."
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、掃除当番か。
#. それなら昨日の朝、モノクマから話があったな！
msgctxt "0049 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Cleaning duty, eh? As a matter of fact, Monokuma came\n"
"and talked to me yesterday morning!"
msgstr ""

#. …ホント！？
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr ""

#. きっと、モノクマも僕がまとめ役だとわかってたんだ！
#. だから僕に直々に言ってきたのだよ。
msgctxt "0051 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"He probably realized I was basically in charge, so he\n"
"decided to talk to me directly!"
msgstr ""

#. 掃除当番を決めてくれってね！！
msgctxt "0052 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"The topic of conversation was...assigning cleaning\n"
"duty!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、石丸クンが掃除当番だったんだね…
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, so you're on cleaning duty now?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、僕は掃除当番ではないぞ。
msgctxt "0054 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Actually, no."
msgstr ""

#. …えっ？　じゃあ誰が？
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Okay, then who is?"
msgstr ""

#. その話があった時、ちょうど山田くんもいてな、
#. 彼が立候補してくれたんで、彼にお願いしたんだ！
msgctxt "0056 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Hifumi was also there when we had this conversation.\n"
"He volunteered right away, so I let him have it!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、掃除当番は…山田クン？
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So *he's* on cleaning duty, then."
msgstr ""

#. 掃除当番は１週間ごとに交代していく予定だ。
#. いずれ君にもお願いする事があるだろう…
msgctxt "0058 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Indeed. But we'll swap out on a weekly basis. I'm sure\n"
"you'll be up before too long."
msgstr ""

#. その時はよろしく頼むぞッ！！
msgctxt "0059 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "And when that time comes, I'll be counting on you!"
msgstr ""
